---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/calibration-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/calibration-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="A hunch alone: right four times, wrong three"
  caption="The times the model decided, with no checked evidence, that an earlier applicant didn't add up."
>
  Seven circles. Four are filled: fake applicants, where the model's hunch was right. Three are hollow: real people, where the hunch was wrong. From a test on 91 earlier applicants.
</Chart>
